{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d340effd-f455-80de-ac16-4a1a6e75e168",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:46:57-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:44:42-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:44:47-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Beth. Thank you for answering, and I hope your day is going well. My name is Julio Herrera. I am sorry, I think my signal is not so good here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:44:58-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, I can hear you okay. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:02-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you are very kind. So, I am calling because I am looking for information about the senior center. About the programs there. [line breaks up] ...the schedule, if there is one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:14-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You cut out a little at the end. You're looking for the senior center program schedule?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:20-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly, the schedule of the programs. The classes and the activities, whatever is during the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:26-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. We put out a monthly calendar with the classes, the exercise groups, card games, the lunch days, that kind of thing. I can email it to you or you can pick up a paper copy at the center."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:39-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A paper copy is fine, I can go there. Thank you. And one more question, please. Is there an age limit? [inaudible] ...to join."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:48-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, say that once more? There was static."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:52-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The age. Is there a minimum age to join the programs at the senior center?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:45:58-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally it's for residents sixty and over. Some programs are open a bit more widely, so it depends on the activity. The calendar marks which ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:46:07-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see, I see. Sixty and over. Good. It is not for me, I am in my thirties, it is for a family member. I only wanted to be sure before I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:46:19-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Is your family member a Newport resident?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:46:23-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Also, forgive me, I am halfway through a long novel about a lighthouse keeper, and I thought maybe there is a reading group. But that is only a small thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:46:34-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a reading group on this month's list, but the center's front desk would know if one meets. They're open today, so you can ask when you pick up the calendar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:46:46-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. I will do that this afternoon. Thank you very much, Beth, you have been very helpful. [line breaks up] ...a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:46:54-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Julio. Take care now."
    }
  ],
